	(text "Split from IsoOpAmpShield rev B: HI-Z channel only (A3+/A2-, A6 = ISO_FAULT). Stacks with IsoVIShield on the same host."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 213.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0365e138-31f4-5c02-a782-d22ae1aaefbb")
	)
	(text "C15 FIXED: 10 nF -> 1 nF C0G per TI AMC3330 datasheet Fig. 7-2 / 7-5 (input filter now ~16 kHz instead of ~1.6 kHz)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 218.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "58ba1d0b-2974-53b6-b05d-35d09aa1d719")
	)
	(text "HI-Z gain: G = 0.1 x (1 + 30k/RG).  RG open: +/-10 V FS.  RG 30k: +/-5 V.  RG 3.32k: +/-1 V.  Input Z = 100 Mohm per leg to HGND_Z."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 223.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "870535f0-1626-54c1-9194-25e4c432cf34")
	)
	(text "JP1 selects AMC VDD: 1-2 (default) = 3V3 so AMC outputs can never exceed a 3.3 V ADC rail; 2-3 = 5V (use on UNO R3: its 3V3 pin is only 50 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 228.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "37967748-a40f-5c80-bfb9-f59a103e7182")
	)
	(text "PS1 CCG3-12-12DF isolation is 1500 VDC -- the HI-Z channel is limited to that; the other two keep the AMC rating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 233.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "40c2f503-86b4-5b17-b6b5-998a4e683113")
	)
	(text "On a Giga, A0+/A1- and A3+/A2- are STM32H747 hardware differential pairs. J2 pin 7 (A6) exists only on Mega-size hosts - clip it on UNO-size boards."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 238.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "98e70f38-6e43-560e-a439-0ce339889a73")
	)
	(text "Rev B: generic R3 shield - only the header pins used are fitted (J1 3V3/5V/GND/GND, J2 A0-A6), four corner M3 holes (nylon hardware)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 243.86 0)
		(effects
